Z||000055||PearlBlueSoul||12-01-2000||11:12 PM||||Hmm....Heaven and Hell.  Because it's heaven for me to drive, to polish up, to see every day when I leave out for school in the morning parked outside (and soon with me driving it to school).  But, I call it hell because sometimes it's an absolute B!TCH to work on, and to get parts for.  <P>regardless, i'll love it always...and if things keep looking good, I might just have a fiero beside it.  Thinkin bout saving up for that other 2 tone fiero on this board.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  <P>------------------<BR>1987 Toyota MR2 N/A 5 speed<BR>  <A HREF="http://www.atlantamr2s.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.atlantamr2s.com</A>  <BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/darionscard" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/darionscard</A>  <BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.geocities.com/darionscard/Thumb.jpg">       <BR><B>Notable mods:</B>  Sus tech springs and sway bars, Toyota strut tower brace, KYB strut inserts, HKS exhaust, NGK plugs/wires, Momo Racer wheels (14x6), Custom intake, Kenwood 12" speaker in front trunk, Jensen amp.||||reg||1
