Z||000076||Formula88||03-04-2001||10:21 PM||||Well, I haven't really named my Formula, yet.  I refer to her sometimes as "the beast."  That's a reference to the premiere episode of Miami Vice, when Tubbs steals the scarab and hits the throttle and screams out "You Beast, You!"  That's how both LZeitgeist and I felt our first time in our Formulas after him having his 88 4cylinder coupe for so long.  Since we both have virtually identical 88 Formulas, they are often referred to together as "The Twins."  Because we usually like to each drive where we go, we usually take both cars.  <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Me&Pat_Cars1.jpg"> <BR>The Twins  (mine's on the left)||||reg||6
